# Apple's system Python links tkinter against the deprecated, crash-prone
# Tcl/Tk 8.5 (TkpInit aborts with SIGABRT when frozen). The build venv must
# be created from a Homebrew Python with `python-tk` installed instead, so
# it's local to each machine rather than checked in.
